 ],
 "synopsis": "IIFL Capital has launched a block deal in Sagility Ltd for up to $249.6 million, equivalent to around Rs 2,377 crore. The promoter, Sagility B.V., is expected to be the seller, likely offloading around 12 percent of the total equity in the company. The offer price is projected to be around Rs 42.45 per share, representing a 4.94 percent discount to the closing price on October 29. The deal is being managed by IIFL Capital.",
